      <ExpenseAmt>107175</ExpenseAmt>
      <Desc>LEGACY: WE NAMED OUR FOUNDATION THE KEELING CURVE FOUNDATION TO HONOR THE LEGACY OF DR. CHARLES DAVID KEELING, A HISTORIC FIGURE IN THE SCIENCE OF CLIMATE CHANGE. THIS ACTIVITY ALSO INVOLVES LEGAL OPPOSITION, WHICH IS NECESSARY TO PROTECT AND HONOR THE LEGACY OF CHARLES DAVID KEELING.</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>20029</ExpenseAmt>
        <GrantAmt>2000</GrantAmt>
        <Desc>OUTREACH: WE ADDED A NEW SECTION,LTO INSIGHTS,ON OUR WEBSITE, HIGHLIGHTING PIVOTAL LONG-TERM OBSERVATION (LTO) DATASETS AND THEIR SIGNIFICANCE IN MONITORING ENVIRONMENTAL CHANGES. WE ALSO ADDED A MONTHLY LTOS IN THE NEWS SECTION ON THE WEBSITE. WE PRESENTED A SESSION, BENDING THE CURVE, AT CLIMATE WEEK IN NYC, WHICH FOCUSED ON THE IMPORTANCE OF LONG-TERM OBSERVATIONS FOR GUIDING CLIMATE POLICIES AND SOLUTIONS. WE HELPED SUPPORT THE ANNUAL KEELING LECTURE, THE TOPIC OF WHICH WAS CLIMATE CHANGE IN THE U.S-MEXICO REGION. WE ALSO ENGAGED TWO SENIOR ADVISORS, WITH EXPERTISE IN COMMUNICATIONS AND OUTREACH.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy3Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>8234</ExpenseAmt>
        <Desc>KEELING AWARD: THIS AWARD WILL BE THE FIRST OF ITS KIND TO HONOR AND RECOGNIZE OUTSTANDING SCIENTISTS CONDUCTING LONG-TERM ENVIRONMENTAL OBSERVATIONS. WE CREATED A SCIENTIFIC PANEL OF EXPERTS TO REVIEW NOMINATIONS FOR THE AWARD AND CONDUCTED AN OUTREACH EVENT TO SPREAD WORD ABOUT THE AWARD. WE CONDUCTED OUTREACH FOR THE AWARD AT CLIMATE WEEK IN NYC.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy3Grp>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActyOtherGrp>
        <ExpenseAmt>8234</ExpenseAmt>
        <Desc>SCIENTIFIC COLLABORATION: WE CREATED A SCIENCE ADVISORY BOARD, WHICH IS DEVELOPING A REPORT THAT EXPLORES THE SOCIETAL BENEFIT, KEY FINDINGS, CHALLENGES, SOLUTIONS, AND ACCELERANTS ENABLING KEY LONG-TERM OBSERVATIONAL DATASETS TO PERSEVERE.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActyOtherGrp>
